WEBVTT

00:00:00.500 --> 00:00:04.776
The Dashboard brings enquiries and applications into one list.

00:00:04.826 --> 00:00:11.127
Action required highlights new submissions and notification emails that were not delivered.

00:00:11.177 --> 00:00:14.616
Choose All to include items already being handled.

00:00:14.666 --> 00:00:19.221
The numbers in the sidebar help you see where attention is needed.
